\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 1r\endash 11r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Missae diversae cum lectionibus}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  (1r) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De sancto Bonifatio\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  CO Nr. 1809. \endash  Lit.: Huth, S. 218, Anm. 25 (zum fehlenden Vorsatzbl.), vgl. auch Ms. D 1, fol. 66r\endash v; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Bibl\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 [iotheca] \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 D\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 [ominorum] \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Can\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 [onicorum] \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Essend\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 [iensium], Nachtrag von einer Hand des 17. Jh.s; (2r) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Lectio epistolae beati Pavli apostoli ad Romanos\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  (Rm 3,19\endash 26); \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria VI sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Matheum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  (Mt 4,12\endash 17); \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Lectio epistolae beati Pavli apostoli ad Gathas \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 [!] \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 fratres\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  (Gal 3,23\endash 29 und 4,1f.); (2v) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria IIII lectio epistolae beati Pavli apostoli ad Colosenses \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 [!] \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 fratres\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  (Col 1,25\endash 28); \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Secundum Iohannem\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  (Lc 4,14\endash 22); (3r) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Lectio libri sapientie\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  (Sir 50,6\endash 12); \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Marcum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  (Mc 13,33\endash 37); \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Vere dignum aeterne deus\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Qui hunc diem sanctum dominicum in tuo nomine consecrasti. O magnus et quam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 bonus est dies iste\u8230 \'85\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; (4r) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De sancto Willibrordo\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  vgl. CO Nr. 1735; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Natalis sancti Willehadi \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 vgl. CO Nr. 2003. \endash  Ed.: Niemeyer, S. 71f., 107; (4v) leer; (5r) [Praefatio in natale sancti Andreae] vgl. CO Nr. 1361; [Orationes diversae] vgl. CO Nr. 6106b, 4938; (5v) [De sancto Petro]. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Deus qui nos beati Petri apostolorum principis uotiuis faci interesse sollemniis\u8230 \'85\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Vigilia sanctarum Virginum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  CO Nr. 1858; (6r) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In natale sancti Landberti episcopi et martyris\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  [G]\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 loriosissimi martyris Landberhti episcopi meritis obsequentes eius officiis omnes fideliter aggregemur\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 \u8230 \'85 siehe auch Ms. D 1, fol. 232r; D 3, fol. 306v; (6v) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Vigilia in purificatione sancte Marie \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 CO Nr. 1163; (7v) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Benediccio cereorum\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Preciosa est in conspectu domini mors sanctorum eius sancta Maria mater domini nostri Jhesu Christi\u8230 \'85\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; (8r) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 sancta cruce \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 vgl. CO Nr. 1730; (8v\endash 9r) leer; (9v) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Lectio actuum Apostolorum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  (Act 1,15\endash 26); (10r) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De sancto Mathia apostolo\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  CO Nr. 1459; [Missa pro vivis sive defunctis] CO Nr. 4227; (10v) [De sanctis Remigii, Germani et Vedasti]. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Beatorum confessorum pariterque pontificum Remigii Germani atque Uedasti nos domine quis festa tueantur\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 \u8230 \'85; [Missa pro abbatissa/Benedictio abbatissae (?)] CO Nr. 1287; (11r) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Lectio actuum Apostolorum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  (Act 1,15\endash 26); \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De sancto Marso oratio\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 , vgl. CO Nr. 1845.}

