\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 20r\endash 26v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Missae votivae et orationes sacerdotis}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  (20r) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oratio sacerdotis ante altare\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ante conspectum diuinae maiestatis tuae deus reus assisto\u8230 \'85\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  Wilmart, S. 113 mit Anm. 2; Odenthal, S. 1\endash 35; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Benedictio Tvris\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Hoc incensum larga tuae benedictionis infusio et hanc creaturam turis splendore\u8230 \'85\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; (20v) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Super oblata\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  CO Nr. 5842a; [Alia oratio super oblata] Deshusses Nr. 3128; [Alia oratio super oblata] CO Nr. 1765; (21r) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Item oratio sacerdotis ante missam\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Omnipotens misericordissime \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 [?]\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 deus qui de indignis dignos de peccatoribus facis iustos\u8230 \'85\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; [Alia oratio ante missam]. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Rogo te altissime sabaoth pater sancte ut me tunica\u8230 \'85\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  Leroquais, Sacramentaires, Bd. 1, S. 86; Andrieu, Bd. 1, S. 55; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Benedictio quando oblatum suscipit.\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Benedic domine hanc oblationem in nomine tuo\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Quando ante altare steterit oblatum super positis Deum supplicando dicat\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Suscipe domine hanc oblationem quam tibi offero in honore domini nostri Jhesu Christi pro me peccatore et pro congregatione nostra et pro fratribus et sororibus meis\u8230 \'85\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; (21v) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Post offertorium dicendum est. Aperi domine os meum ad benedicendum nomen tuum\u8230 \'85; Oratio pro defunctis ante missorum sollemnum \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 [!]\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  Ante conspectum maiestatis tuae miserere domine omnium animarum proquibus me oratiorum promisi..\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Post offertorium ante altare \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 CO 5842a; (22r) [Amalarius Metensis: Eclogae de ordine Romano et de quattuor orationibus episcoporum sive populi in missa]. \endash  Ed.: Hanssen, Bd. 3, S. 229ff. c. I.2 \endash c. XV, S. 258f. c. XXVI; (22v) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Missa pro semet ipso\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  CO 3738; (23v) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Missa in tribulatione posita\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  Deshusses Nr. 2463ff.; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Missa de tribulatione\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  Deshusses Nr. 2497; (24r) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Missa pro inimicis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  Deshusses Nr. 2669ff.; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Missa pro vivis et mortuis. Deus cui proprium est misereri semper et parcere maiestatem tuam suppliciter deprecor\u8230 \'85\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  vgl. Deshusses Nr. 1327, 2886; (25r) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Missa pro remissione. Deus qui nullum respuis nullumque contemnis\u8230 \'85\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  vgl. Deshusses Nr. 2672; CO Nr. 1939; (25v) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Missa pro paganis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  Deshusses Nr. 2564ff.; (26r)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Benedictio stolarum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  Deshusses Nr. 4135; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Alia missa pro episcopo et congregatione\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  Deshusses Nr. 3130\endash 3133; (26v) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Gregorius Flatu superi; Gelasius atque missas cum sensu conficiunt parili\u8230 \'85\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  \endash  Ed.: MGH Poet. lat., Bd. 5,3, S. 674 Nr. 3 (Text). \endash Lit.: Chroust, zur Tafel 8; Ebner, S. 453f.; Jammers, Bedeutung, S. 9; Ders., Neumenhandschriften, Tafel 8; Ders., Pal\u228 \'e4ofr\u228 \'e4nkische Neumenschrift, S. 255ff.; Kahsnitz, Werdener Psalter, S. 38 mit Abb. 398f.; Karpp, Mittelalterliche Hss. (II), S. 73; Fingernagel, Bd. 1, S. 68f. Nr. 71; Bd. 2, S. 101, Abb. 221; Palazzo, S. 68f., 216f.; Krone und Schleier, S. 215f., Nr. 64; Winterer, S. 119\endash 126 mit Abb. 123, S. 379f.; [Alia missa]. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sanctae Dei genitricis et uirginis Mariae et omnium sanctorum tuorum intercessionibus\u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 ad purgationem peccatorum et ad tutamentum.}

