mandatum faciendum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Orationes quae dicende sunt feria VI maiore mane in Hierusalem\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Primo legitur lectio in Oseae deinde canitur responsorium\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (67ar) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Quando sacerdos alba induitur celebraturus missam dicat. Indue me domine uestimento iocunditatis et spiritali intellectu \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  Nachtrag; (67av) [Praefatio].\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Vere dignum ne reuerentiae tuae dicato ieiunio gratulantes quia ueneranda omnium sanctorum \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad complendum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  CO Nr. 5159, Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge von sp\u228 \'e4terer Hand; (68r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ut supra deinde legatur altera lectio in Exodo quam subsequatur tractum<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Erime \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 [!] \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 domine ab homine malo\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 quo expleto legatur passio domini secundum Iohannem hic expletis sequantur orationes hae sollemnes\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \endash Lit.: Dausend, S. 91; (69v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Benedictio cerei\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Vere quia dignum< et iustum >est inuisibilem\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Deum\u8230 \'85 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 \endash  Lit.: Dausend, S. 91; (71r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Orationes per singulas lectiones in sabbato sancto paschae\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Prima lectio in principio\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Orationes per singulas lectiones in sabbato sancto. Prima lectio in principio\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (71v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sequitur de Noe II. Noe vero\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De Abraham III. Temptavit deus Abraham\p