\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 214v\endash 218v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Obsequium circa morientes/Obsequium mortuorum}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 (214v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Incipit obsequium circa morientes quando aliquis ad mortem propinquaverit primitus fiat laetania et antequam anima exeat de corpore dicat sacerdos hanc oratio\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Deshusses Nr. 3979bis; (215r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Tunc presbyter det viaticum et post communionem dicat orationem\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < CO Nr. 315; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Postquam autem defunctus fuerit primo dicatur ista collecta\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Deshusses Nr. 1398; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Postea cantent istud responsorium sine uersu. Sequatur oratio. Responsorium\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Subuenite sancti Dei\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  Ottosen, S. 401; Deshusses Nr. 1399; (215v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Tunc imponet cantor istam antiphonam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < CAO Nr. 7716a; Ps 113; Deshusses Nr. 1400; CAO Nr. 1783; Ps 114; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Et pater noster<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In memoria aeterna\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dicant simul Kyrie eleyson ter\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; Ps 24,13; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ne intres in iudicium cum servo tuo domine\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; Ps 73,19; CAO Nr. 4617 (= GrRom, Ordinarium Missae, S. 95*); Ps 50; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ne intres in iudicium cum servo tuo domine\u8230 \'85\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; (216r) CAO Nr. 4617 (= GrRom, Ordinarium Missae, S. 95*); \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Requiescat in pace\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Postea lauetur et ponatur in feretro et antequam dedamo \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 [!] \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 egrediantur facto signo collectis fratribus dicat sacerdos hanc orationem\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Deshusses Nr. 1407; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Tunc ferent corpus in ecclesiam cantantes antiphonam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < CAO Nr. 3266; Ps 24; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Tu iussisti nasci me\u8230 \'85\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; Ps 64,2; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Et postquam in ecclesia positus fuerit dum ista prescipta fuerint impleta orent omnes unanimiter pro ipsa anima dicentes simul Kyrie eleyson ter et pater noster, sequitur oratio\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Deshusses Nr. 1402, 1408; (216v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Et postea deputandi sunt qui ipsum corpus cus\plain \f3\i\lang1024\fs22 todiant, sit autem in \u281 \'eacclesia constitutum quousque pro ipsa anima miss\u281 \'ea celebrantur et antequam ipsum corpus eleuetur dicat sacerdos oratio \plain \f3\lang1024\fs22 [!]\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Deshusses Nr. 4055; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Tunc incipiat cantor responsorium\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < CAO Nr. 7716 (= GrRom, Ordinarium Missae, S. 107*); CAO Nr. 7716a (= GrRom, Ordinarium Missae, S. 108*); >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Hic dicant omnes simul kyrie eleyson ter, sequitur\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Deshusses Nr. 4056; CAO Nr. 6107, 6507a; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Et dicant simul Kyrie eleyson, sequitur oratio\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Deshusses Nr. 4057; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Postquam elevatur de aecclesia cantor inponat antiphonam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < CAO Nr. 3266; (217r) Ps 24; Deshusses Nr. 2877; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Tu iussisti nasci me\u8230 \'85\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; Ps 64,2; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oratio\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 ante sepulchrum priusquam sepeliatur\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Deshusses Nr. 1409; Cantus ID 205374 (= GrRom, Proprium sanctorum pro aliquibus locis, S. 38**); Ps 117; Deshusses Nr. 1410; (217v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ingrediatur hic deponatur in sepulchrum et dicat sacerdos\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < CAO Nr. 3335; Ps 41; Deshusses Nr. 1411f.; CAO Nr. 3012; Ps 131; Deshusses Nr. 1413; (218r) CAO Nr. 7533; Ps 50; Deshusses Nr. 1414f., 1404; (218v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Oratio in cimiterio\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Deshusses Nr. 1444, 1447. \endash  Lit.: H\u252 \'fcrlimann, S. 49f.}

