1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sabbato ad sanctum Petrum quando elemosina datur\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominica in palmis ad sanctum Iohannem\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; (8r) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria IIII ad sanctum Laurentium foris murum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria V ad Apostolos\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria UI ad sanctam Mariam ad martyrem\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sabbato ad sanctum Iohannem\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Die dominica post albas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De pascha annotina\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f3\i\lang1024\fs22 Dominica I post octabas pasch\u281 \'ea\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f3\i\lang1024\fs22 Dominica II post octabas pasch\u281 \'ea\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; (8v) \plain \f3\i\lang1024\fs22 Dominica III post octabas pasch\u281 \'ea\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f3\i\lang1024\fs22 Dominica IIII post octabas pasch\u281 \'ea\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Idibus aprilis natale sanctae Eufemiae uirginis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 XVIII kalendas maias natale sanctorum Tiburcii et Ualeriani et Maximi\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 VIIII kalendas maias natale sancti Georgii martiris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 VII kalendas maias letania maior ad sanctum Laurentium in Lucana\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; (9r) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Kalendis maiis natale apostolorum Philippi et Iacobi\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f3\i\lang1024\fs22 De inuentione sanct\u281 \'ea crucis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 IIII idus maias natale sancti Pancratii\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In uigilia ascensa domini\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In ascensa domini\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ;\plain \f2\i\lang1033\