\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 171r\endash 175v\plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Hymni ad terciam cantandi}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  Im 13. Jh. erg\u228 \'e4nzte, anl\u228 \'e4sslich der Terz zu singende Hymnen f\u252 \'fcr das ganze Kirchenjahr, mit Notation, ohne gr\u252 \'fcne a-Linie. Zur Identifizierung der einzelnen Ges\u228 \'e4nge vgl. auch GrCist, Ordinarium Missae, S. 183*\endash 190*. (171r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In adventu domini ad IIIam ymnus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Conditor alme syderum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 51, Nr. 47; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In natiuitate domini<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 A solis ortus cardine \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 50, Nr. 53 (Str. 1\endash 4); (171v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In quadragesima ymnus<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Audi benigne conditor\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 51, Nr. 54; (172r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominica in passione et in utroque festo sancte crucis<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Vexilla regis prodeunt, fulget\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 12, Nr. 493; (172v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo palmarum ad terciam ymnus<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Iam surgit hora tertia\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 50, Nr. 6; (173r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo Pasche ymnus<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Chorus noue Iherusalem\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 2, Nr. 131; (173v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In ascensione domini ymnus ad IIIam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Eterne rex altissime\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 51, Nr. 88 (ohne Str. 5 und 7); (174r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo Pentecostes<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ueni creator spiritus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 2, Nr. 132; (174v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominicis diebus ymnus<.\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Nunc sancte nobis spiritus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 50, Nr. 18; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De virginis \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 [!] \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 in omnibus festis<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 O quam glorifica luce choruscas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 2, Nr. 30; (175r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Omnium sanctorum ad terciam ymnus<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sanctorum meritis inclita gaudia\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 50, Nr. 153.}

