\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 175v\endash 179v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Antiphonae ad tertiam cantandae}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  Zu Beginn des 13. Jh.s (?) erg\u228 \'e4nzte, anl\u228 \'e4sslich der Terz zu singende Antiphonen mit Notation. Zur Identifizierung der einzelnen Ges\u228 \'e4nge vgl. auch GrCist, Ordinarium Missae, S. 190*\endash 223*. (175v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In adventu domini et aliis dominicis ad IIIam antiphonam<. Alleluia, alleluia, alleluia, alleluia \u8230 \'85\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In nativitate domini ad terciam antiphonam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. CAO Nr. 5452; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In circumcisionem\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < CAO Nr. 4669; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In epyphaniam antiphona\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < CAO Nr. 1447; (176r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In octavas epyphanie antiphona\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < CAO Nr. 1552; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominica prima in quadragesima\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < CAO Nr. 3288; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Secunda dominica\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < CAO Nr. 3795; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominica IIIa antiphona\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < CAO Nr. 4486; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominica IIIIa\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < CAO Nr. 2117; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominica in passione domini antiphona\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < CAO Nr. 3518; (176v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In palmis antiphona\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < CAO Nr. 4416; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In Pascha usque pentecosten< \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 CAO Nr. 5079; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria secunda post pentecosten\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < CAO Nr. 4613; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Trinitatis antiphona\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < CAO Nr. 4086; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Stephani antiphona\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < CAO Nr. 1272; >\plain \f2\i\lang10