\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 3r\endash 134v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Antiphonale officii, Proprium de tempore}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  Winterteil, Anfang fehlt, Beginn mit den Laudes des zweiten Advents bis zu den Laudes des Karsamstags. Der Inhalt entspricht dem Ordinarium des dominikanischen Prototyps, Guerrini Nr. 21\endash 157. (3r) [Dominica secunda in adventu domini] // \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 et quia ligna siluarum plaudent\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 \u8230 \'85; (4v) [Dominica tertia]; (12r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominica IIIIa\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (20v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In vigilia natalis domini\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (23v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In natale domini\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (30v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In circumcisione domini\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (35v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In vigilia epiphanie\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (36v) [In epiphanie]; (44r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominica prima post octavam epiphanie\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (63r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominica IIa post octavam epiphanie\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominica IIIa\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (63v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominica IIIIa<\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominica in LXX\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (69v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominica in LX\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (74r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominica in quinquagesima\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (78r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria IIIIa in capite ieiunii\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (79r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominica in XL\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (86v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominica secunda\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  [in quadragesima]<; (92v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominica IIIa in XL\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (99v) >\plain \f2\i