\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 135r\endash 208r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Proprium de sanctis}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  Von der Vigil des hl. Andreas (30. Nov.) bis zum Fest der Verk\u252 \'fcndigung des Herrn (25. M\u228 \'e4rz), entspricht dem Ordinarium des dominikanischen Prototyps, ed. Guerrini. (135r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In vigilia sancti Andree\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 307; (140r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancti Nicholai episcopi\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 308; (145v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancte Lucie virginis et martyris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 310; (147r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo sancti Thome apostoli\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 311; (148v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Memoria de sancto Stephano\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 312; (153v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Memento de sancto Iohanne ewangeliste\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 313; (159v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Memento de innocentibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 314; (164v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancte Agnetis uirginis et martyris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 327; (170r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancti Vincentii martyris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 328; (178r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In conuersione sancti Pauli apostoli\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 330; (186r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In purificatione beate Marie\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 334; (194r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancte Agathe uirginis et martyris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 336; (200v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In cathedra sancti Petri\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 340; (201v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo sancti Gregorii\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 343; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In annunciatione d