\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 253ra\endash 258va {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Hymnarium, Hymni de tempore}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  (253r) Amenmelodien f\u252 \'fcr die unterschiedlichen Tonarten (\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 re\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 , \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 mi\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 , \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 ut\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 , \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 sol\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ) am unteren Rand; (253ra) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Per aduentum ad vesperam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Conditor alme siderum \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 47, Str. 1\endash 4, 5\endash 7; (253rb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad matutinam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Verbum supernum prodiens\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 51, Nr. 48; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Vox clara ecce\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 51, Nr. 49; (253va) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In natiuitate domini ad uesperas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Veni redemptor gentium \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 50, Nr. 8, Str. 2\endash 8 von \u8218 \'82Intende qui regis Israel\lquote \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  \endash Lit.: St\u228 \'e4blein, Hymnen (I), S. XVI; Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge am Rand; (254ra) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad matutinam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Christe redemptor omnium\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 51, Nr. 50; (254rb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 A solis ortus cardine \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 50, Nr. 53, Str. 1\endash 7; (254va) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In epiphania ad vesperam et ad matutinam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Hostis Herodes impie \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 50, Nr. 53, Str. 8\endash 9, 11, 13 von \u8218 \'82A solis ortus cardine\lquote \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  \endash Lit.: St\u228 \'e4blein, Hymnen (I), S. XVI; (254vb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 A patre unigenitus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 2, Nr. 107; (255ra) ohne Rubrik, \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 O lux beata trinitas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 51, Nr. 40; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad completorium\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Te lucis ante terminum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 51, Nr. 44; (255rb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad matutinam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Nocte surgentes vigilemus \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 24; (255va) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ecce iam noctis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 51, Nr. 31; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad primam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Iam lucis orto sydere \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 41; (255vb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad IIIam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Nunc sancte nobis spiritus \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 50, Nr. 18; (256ra) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad VIam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Rector potens uerax deus \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 50, Nr. 19; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad nonam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Rerum deus tenax uigor\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 50, Nr. 20; (256rb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad vesperam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Lvcis creator optime \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 34; (256va) Ferialoffizium, Melodien der vorgenannten Hymnen an Ferialtagen: >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad matutinas et laudes cantus ferialis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Nocte surgentes uigilemus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Cantus ferialis ad horas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Iam lucis orto sydere\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Cantus ferialis ad uesperas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Lvcis creator optime\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; (256vb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominica in XLam ad uesperas ymnus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Audi benigne conditor\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 51, Nr. 54; (257ra) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad completorium\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Christe qui lux es et dies\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 51, Nr. 22; (257rb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad matutinam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Svmmi largitor praemii\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 51, Nr. 60; (257va) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Iam Christe sol iusticie\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 51, Nr. 59, Str. 1\endash 5; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominica in passione domini ad vesperam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Vexilla regis prodeunt\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 50, Nr. 67, Str. 1, 3\endash 8; (258ra) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad matutinam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Pange lingua gloriosi\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 50, Nr. 66, Str. 1\endash 5; (258rb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Lustra sex qui iam peracta \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 50, Nr. 66, Str. 6\endash 10.}

