\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 89r\endash 220v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Proprium de sanctis et commune sanctorum}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  Entspricht dem Ordinarium des dominikanischen Prototyps, Guerrini, vgl. auch Berkenkamp, S. 23f. (89r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In annuntiatione dominica paschalis temporis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 345; (93r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In communi unius apostoli vel plurimorum siue vnius ewangeliste in paschali tempore\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 347; (95r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In communi unius martyris siue confessoris in paschali tempore\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 348; (96r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In communi plurimorum martyrum in paschali tempore\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 349; (96v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancti Petri martyris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 355; (100r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sanctorum apostolorum Philippi et Jacobi\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 356; (101r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In inuencione sancte crucis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 357; (104v) [In festo Coronae] Guerrini Nr. 358; (107r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Johannis ante Portam Latinam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 359; (107v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In translatione beati Dominici\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 363; (110v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In vigilia sancti Iohannis baptiste\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 375, vgl. fol. 253r\endash 260v, weiteres Officium zu diesem Fest; (116v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In octava die sancti Iohannis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 380; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sanctorum Iohannis et Pauli\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 376; (119r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo apostolorum Petri et Pauli\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 378; (126r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In commemoracione sancti Pauli\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 379; (132r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Per octavam apostolorum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 381; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancte Marie Magdalene\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 387; (138v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancti Jacobi\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 390; (139r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancti Petri ad vincula\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 395; (139v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In inuencione Stephani protomartyris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 397; (141v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo sancti patris nostri Dominici\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 398; (148r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo sancti Laurentii\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 402; (154v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In assumptione beate virginis Marie\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 406 und 407; (161v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancti Augustini episcopi\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 414; (170r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In decollatione sancti Iohannis baptiste\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 415; (172r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In natiuitate sancte Marie virginis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 419; (178r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In exaltacione sancte crucis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 422; (183v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancti Mychaelis archangeli\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 428; (190r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festiuitate omnium sanctorum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 441; (197r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad uesperas defunctorum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 442; (203r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancti Martini episcopi\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 445; (209v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancte Cecilie uirginis et martyris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 448; (215r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancti Clementis pape et martyris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 449; (217v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancte Katerine virginis et martyris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 451.}

