\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 282r\endash 287vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Hymnarium, Hymni de tempore}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  Von der Osteroktav bis Kirchweih, mit Amenmelodien f\u252 \'fcr die unterschiedlichen Tonarten (re, mi, ut, sol). (282r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In octauis pasche ad vesperas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad cenam agni prouidi \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 2, Nr. 44; (282vb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad completam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ihesu nostra redemptio \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 2, Nr. 49, Str. 1\endash 4; (283ra) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad matutinam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Avrora lucis rutilat\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 51, Nr. 84, Str. 1\endash 5; (283rb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sermone blando angelus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 , Divisio des vorigen Hymnus, Str. 6\endash 11; (283va) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Cantus ferialis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Iam lucis orto sydere\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 51, Nr. 41, Str. 1; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In ascensione domini ad vesperas et ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Eterne rex altissime\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 2, Nr. 47, Str. 1\endash 5, 8, mit Abweichungen; (283vb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Tu Criste nostrum gaudium\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 , Divisio des vorigen Hymnus, Str. 5\endash 8, mit Abweichungen; (284ra) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In pentecostes ad vesperas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Beata nobis gaudia \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 2, Nr. 51; (284rb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Iam Christus astra ascenderat\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 51, Nr. 92, Str. 1\endash 4; (284va) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Impleta gaudent uiscera\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 , Divisio des vorigen Hymnus, Str. 5\endash 8; (284vb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Per totam ebdomadam ad tertiam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Veni creator spiritus \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 2, Nr. 132; (285ra) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo trinitatis ad vesperas et ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Adesto sancta trinitas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 51, Nr. 96; (285rb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 O trinitas laudabilis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 43, Nr. 9, Str. 1\endash 3; (285va) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo dedicationis ecclesie et in anniuersario eiusdem ad vesperas et ad matutinam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Urbs beata Jerusalem\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 2, Nr. 93, Str. 1\endash 5, 11; (285vb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Angulare fundamentum lapis Christus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 , Divisio des vorigen Hymnus, Str. 6, 8\endash 9, mit zus\u228 \'e4tzlicher neuer Str.; (286ra) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sabbatis ad vesperas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 O lux beata trinitas \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 40, mit Doxologie; (286ra) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad completorium\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <.\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Te lucis ante terminum \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 44; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad matutinam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Nocte surgentes uigilemus omnes \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 24; (286va) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ecce iam noctis \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 31, Str. 1\endash 2; (286vb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad primam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Iam lucis orto sydere\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 51, Nr. 41; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad IIIam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Nvnc sancte nobis spiritus \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 50, Nr. 18, mit Doxologie; (287ra) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad sextam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Rector potens uerax deus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 50, Nr. 19; (287rb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad IXam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Rerum deus tenax \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 50, Nr. 20; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad uesperas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Lvcis creator optime \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 34; (287va) weitere Melodien zu den vorigen Hymnen f\u252 \'fcr Ferialtage.}

