\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 287vb\endash 300v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Hymnarium, Hymni de sanctis et de commune sanctorum}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  (287vb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In annunciatione dominica ad uesperas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ave maris stella \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 2, Nr. 29; (288ra) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad matutinam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Qvem terra pontus \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 4, Nr. 130; (288rb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 O gloriosa domina\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 , Divisio des Hymnus \u8218 \'82Quem terra pontus\lquote AH Bd. 2, Nr. 27, Str. 5\endash 7, 9; (288va) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo sancti Petri martyris ad vesperas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Magne dies letitie\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 52, Nr. 325; (288vb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Adest triumphus nobilis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 52, Nr. 326; (289rb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Exsultet claro sydere \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 52, Nr. 327; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In utroque festo sancte crucis ad vesperas et ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Salue crux sancta \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 50, Nr. 223, Str. 1, 2, 5, mit Abweichungen; (289va) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Originale crimen necans\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 , Divisio des vorigen Hymnus, Str. 3, 4; (289vb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo corone domini ad matutinam et ad vesperas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Eterne regi glorie\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 , AH Bd. 52, Nr. 12; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Lauda fidelis contio \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 52, Nr. 13; (290ra) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In natiuitate sancti Iohannis baptiste ad vesperas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ut queant laxis \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 50, Nr. 96, Str. 1\endash 4, 13; (290rb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad matutinam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Antra deserti teneris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 , Divisio des vorigen Hymnus, Str. 5\endash 8; (290va) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 O nimis felix\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 , weitere Divisio, Str. 9\endash 13; (290vb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo apostolorum Petri et Pauli ad uesperas et matutinam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Avrea luce et decore roseo\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 51, Nr. 188, Str. 1\endash 2, 5\endash 6; (291ra) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In commemoratione sancti Pauli ad vesperas et ad matutinam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Doctor egregie Paule\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 , Str. 4 des vorigen Hymnus; (291rb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo sancte Praxedis uirginis ad matutinam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Huius obtentu\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 , nur Incipit, vgl. AH Bd. 51, Nr. 121, Str. 4; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo sancte Marie Magdalene ad vesperas et ad matutinam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Lauda mater ecclesia \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 52, Nr. 283, Str. 1\endash 4, 6\endash 7; (291va) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Eterni patris unice \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 52, Nr. 284, Str. 1\endash 3, 6\endash 7; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad uincula sancti Petri ad uesperas et ad matutinam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Iam bone pastor \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 188, Str. 3, 6 von \u8218 \'82Aurea luce et decore roseo\lquote ; (291vb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo beati Dominici ad uesperas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Gaude mater ecclesia\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 52, Nr. 171; (292ra) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad matutinam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Nouus athleta domini\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 52, Nr. 172; (292rb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ymnum noue letitie \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 52, Nr. 173; (292va) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In assumptione beate uirginis ad vesperas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Aue maris stella\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad matutinam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Quem terra\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 O gloriosa domina\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo Augustini ad vesperas et ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Magne pater Augustine\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 52, Nr. 117; (292rb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Celi ciues applaudite\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 52, Nr. 118, Str. 1, 3\endash 6; Im Folgenden nur Incipits zu vorigen Texten und Melodien: (293ra) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In natiuitate beate uirginis ad vesperas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Aue maris stella\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad matutinam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Quem terra\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 O gloriosa domina\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In exaltatione sancte crucis ad vesperas et ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Salue crux\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Originale crimen\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo sancti Mychaelis ad uesperas et ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Tibi Christe splendor patris \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 2, Nr. 77; (293rb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Christe sanctorum decus angelorum \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 2, Nr. 76; (293va) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo sancti Remigii episcopi et confessoris ad matutinam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Iste confessor domini sacratus \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 118, Str. 1/2, mit abweichender Strophenaufteilung; (293vb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo omnium sanctorum ad vesperas et ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ihesu saluator seculi \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 130; (294ra)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 >In laudibus<.\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Christe redemptor omnium \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 129; (294rb)>\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo sancte Katerine uirginis et martyris ad vesperas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Katerine collaudamus uirtutum \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 52, Nr. 245, Str. 1\endash 3, mit Doxologie; (294va) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad matutinam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Pange lingua gloriose uirginis martyrium \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 52, Nr. 246, Str. 1 und vom vorigen Hymnus Str. 5, 7 mit textlichen Abweichungen, Doxologie; (294vb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <.\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Presens dies expendatur \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 52, Nr. 247, Str. 1, 3\endash 4; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo apostolorum et ewangelistarum ad vesperas et ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Exultet celum laudibus \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 108, ohne Notation; (295ra) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Eterna Christi munera \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 50, Nr. 17, Str. 1\endash 2, 6\endash 8, ohne Notation; (295rb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo unius martyris ad vesperas et ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Deus tuorum militum \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 114a, ohne Notation; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Martyr dei qui unicum \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 113, Str. 1\endash 3, ohne Notation; (295va) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo simplici plurimorum martyrum ad vesperas et ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sanctorum meritis inclita gaudia \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 50, Nr. 153; (295vb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo trium lectionum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <, Text wie zuvor; (296ra) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Eterna Christi munera \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 50, Nr. 17, Str. 1, 3\endash 5, 8, ohne Notation; Hymnentexte zu den Festen eines Bekenners bzw. einer Jungfrau mit verschiedenen Melodien zu unterschiedlichen Festgraden: \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 >In festo semiduplici vnius confessoris ad vesperas et ad matutinas<. Iste confessor domini sacratus \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 118, (296rb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo simplici<\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 , Text wie zuvor; (296va)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 >In festo trium lectionum<\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 , Text wie zuvor; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ihesu redemptor omnium corona \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 2, Nr. 100; (296vb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo vnius uirginis ad vesperas et ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  Uirginis proles opifexque matris \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 121, mit Doxologie; (297ra) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo trium lectionum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <, Text wie zuvor; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ihesu corona uirginum \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 2, Nr. 104; (297rb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festis duplicibus et totis duplicibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Iam lucis orto sidere \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 41, Str. 1; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo semiduplici\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <, Text wie zuvor; (297va) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo simplici\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <, Text wie zuvor; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo trium lectionum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <, Text wie zuvor; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Infra octauas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <, Text wie zuvor; (297vb) [In omnibus festis BMV]. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ave maris stella \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 123, Str. 1; [Ad matutinam]. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Quem terra pontus \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 2, Nr. 27, Texte wie oben, weitere Melodie; (298ra) im Folgenden sind nur die Anf\u228 \'e4nge der schon zuvor genannten Hymnen mit Hinweisen angegeben, wann sie noch zu singen sind.}

