\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 209v\endash 216v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Sequentiar}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Sequentiar mit den an den Hochfesten zu singenden Sequenzen, bricht wegen Lagenverlust ab.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (209v) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 In natiuitate domini et duobus diebus sequentibus et in epyphania et in purificatione sequentia<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Letabundus exultet fidelis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 54, Nr. 2; (210v) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 In die pasche et duobus sequentibus sequentia<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Victime paschali laudes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 54, Nr. 7; (211r) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 In ascensione domini sequentia<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Omnes gentes plaudite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 54, Nr. 152; (212v) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 In die pentecostes sequentia<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancti spiritus assit nobis gratia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 53, Nr. 70; (214r) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 In crastino pentecostes et die sequenti sequentia<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ueni sancte spiritus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 54, Nr. 153; (215r) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo trinitatis sequentia<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Profitentes unitatem ueneremur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 54, Nr. 161; (216r) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 In die consecrationis et in anniuersario dedicationis ecclesie sequentia<.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Rex Salomon fecit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 55, Nr. 31, Str. 1\endash 8, bricht nach \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Prima signat uiuos \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ab, die folgende Lage fehlt.}

