\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 2r\endash 3v{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Hymni Mariani}}\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 Nachtrag von zwei H\u228 \'e4nden (15./16. Jh.): (2r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ave rosa sine spinis te quam Pater in divinis majestate sublimavit \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 post mortem in eternum Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  , vgl. RH 2084b; (2v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Felix mater ave qua mundus solvitur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  RH 26502; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ineffabilem clementiam tuam intemerata mater et virgo\u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 regina cum illo qui venit et regnat deus omnipotens in secula Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; (3r) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 O dulcissima regina mundi dei genitrix virgo Maria dignare me\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 quodam privilegio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 in amenitate\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 summe beatitudinis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 recepisti. Ave Maria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , entspricht fast w\u246 \'f6rtlich den Benedictus-Orationes in Paris, BN, Ms. lat. 1409, fol. 106r (14. Jh.). \endash  Druck: Meersseman: Bd. 2, S. 187\endash 188, Nr. 1\endash 12.}

