\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 4r\endash 5v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Hymnus et Orationes variae}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Christe qui lux es et dies \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 22; RH 2934; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Pax domini nostri Jhesu Christi virtus passionis, signum sanctissime \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 Haimerl, Gebetbuchliteratur, S. 80, Anm. 462; (4v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Si insurgunt adversum me castra non timebit cor meum. Jhesus autem transiens per medium illorum ibat\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; Gebetsanweisung\plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 , \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 mndl., in roter Tinte. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Leest dese navolgende gebeden mit iij Pater noster en iij Ave Maria ter eren den liden ons heren dat hi iij uren levendich voer ons geleden heeft hangende aen den heiligen cruce<. \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 Orationes.\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 O emanuel leo fortis\u8230 \'85; Benedicat me deus pater qui in principio\u8230 \'85; \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (5r) \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Crux Christi sit mecum\u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (5v) \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 per medium illorum ibat. Amen. Irruat super eos formido et pavor \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (Ex 15,16)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  In nomine patris et filii et spiritus sancti .. \endash .. me pie consolationis infusio. Amen.}

