\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 49v\endash 51v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Orationes de passione Christi}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Libera me domine fili dei vivi qui in cruce suspensus fuisti et lancea latus perforari permisisti\u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Salutacio Jhesu in cruce\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ave benigne domine Jhesu Christe gratia plenus misericordia tecum benedicta passio vulnera et mors tua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  , vgl. Ebstorf, Klosterbibl., Hs. IV 4, fol. 39v: Giermann/H\u228 \'e4rtel, Handschriften, S. 7; (50r)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Benedictum sit dulce nomen domini nostri Jhesu Christi et dulcissime virginis Marie matris eius in eternum et ultra. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Nos cum prole pia benedicat et custodiat virgo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 RH 39142; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 A subitanea et improvisa morte liberet nos Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Hanc orationem devote legentibus infra missarum solempnia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \u8230 \'85\endash \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 quot fuerunt vulnera crucifixi Jhesu vicem quinque milia trecenti et viginti. Oratio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Precor te piissime domine Jhesu Christe propter caritatem qua tu rex celestis pendebas in cruce \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 Leroquais, Bd. 2, S. 443; Wilmart, Auteurs spirituels, S. 377, Anm. 1, Nr. 12; (50v) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Oratio contra accusationes et machinationes falsas inimicorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Domine deus altissime qui tribus pueris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85; (51r) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Utilis oratio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Domine deus omnipotens qui dissipasti consilium linguarum iniquarum conspirantium contra divinitatis tue potentiam \u8230 \'85 \endash \u8230 \'85 valeant contra me exercere. Qui vivis et regnas per infinita secula. Amen.}

