\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 51v\endash 53r Gebete zu den f\u252 \'fcnf Wunden Jesu\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\caps\lang1033\fs22 Q\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 uantor voulda comenchee dire ou faire quelche chose\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <, nur Rubrik in frz. Sprache, dann weiter mit \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Jhesu pie Jhesu bone Jhesu dulcissime \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \u8230 \'85 \endash \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 ad laudem sanctissimi nominis tui. Amen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , vgl. Leroquais, Bd. 2, S. 125. >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad caput spinis coronatum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ave caput inclinatum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 RH 23377; (52r) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Oratio repetenda infra scriptas orationes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ave benigne Jhesu Christe rex crucifixe gratia plenus misericordia tecum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85 ; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad dextram manum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Palma Christi dextre manus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \u8230 \'85; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad manum sinistram\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Rubicunda leva Christi perforata que fuisti clavo perdurissimo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \u8230 \'85; (52v) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad vultum cordis Christi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 O fons ortus paradysi a quo domino bis divisi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Oratio ad vulnus dextri pedis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Nunc te vulnus dextri pedis quod sic nervos Christi ledis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \u8230 \'85; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Sinistri pedis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Complector pedis perforati vulnus levi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \u8230 \'85; (53r) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 V\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 < \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Adoramus te Christe et benedicimus tibi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \u8230 \'85; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Domine Jhesu Christe qui in cruce expansus quinque vulnera in tuo sacratissimo corpore suscepisti\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  }

