\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 60v\endash 73r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Orationes ad BMV}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Mariengebete lat., frz. (60v) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Maniere de soy commande a la vierge Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Noble dame mere du redemptuer \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 Sonet, Nr. 1241; (61r) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Commenda ad gloriosissimam virginem Mariam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 In manus tuas gloriosissima virgo Maria mater mea\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 ego miserrimus peccator commendo hodie et in omni tempore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \u8230 \'85; >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Julius papa secundus fecit hanc orationem sequentem dicendam flexis genibus ante ymaginem beate semper virginis Marie\u8230 \'85 \endash \u8230 \'85 Nichilominus orationem Sixti pape 4i semper permanente in suo vigore\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <; (61v) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ave sanctissima virgo Maria, mater domini nostri Jhesu Christi, regina celi, porta paradisi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \u8230 \'85; (62r) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Salutatio ad beatam virginem Mariam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ave cuius conceptio solemni plena gaudio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 RH 1744; (62v) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Oratio devota de nostra domina\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Virgo Maria mediatrix nostra oro te mater sancta\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \u8230 \'85; (63r) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Salutatio ad beatam virginem Mariam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ave fuit prima salus qua vincitur hostis malus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 30, Nr. 90; (64r) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Item de beata virgine Maria\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ave virgo graciosa, stella sole clarior\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , vgl. Meersseman, Bd. 1, S. 220; (68r) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Oratio de septem gaudiis beate Marie virginis corporalibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Gaude virgo mater Christi que per aurem concepisti \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 Leroquais, Bd. 2, S. 409; (68v) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Septem gaudia spiritualia beatissime virginis Marie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Gaude flore virginali\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash Druck: Leroquais, Bd. 2, S. 343; (69r) \plain \f1\scaps\lang1033\fs22 De compassione BMV\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Devota contemplacio beate Marie virginis iuxta crucem filii \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (69v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 sui lacrimantis et ad compassionem salvatoris singulos invitantis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Stabat mater dolorosa iuxta crucem lacrimosa\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 54, Nr. 201, mit abschlie\u223 \'dfendem Versikel und Gebet: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 V\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Tuam ipsius animam doloris gladius pertransivit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Interveniat pro nobis quesumus domine Jhesu Christe\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 nunc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 et hora mortis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  , vgl. Hs. 26, Freiburg, UB, fol. 291v: Winfried Hagenmaier, in: Die lateinischen mittelalterlichen Handschriften der Universit\u228 \'e4tsbibliothek Freiburg im Breisgau, Wiesbaden 1988 , Bd. 1/4, S. 413; (70r) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Oratio devotissima ad beatam virginem Mariam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <; (70v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Obsecro te domina sancta Maria mater dei pietate plenissima summi regis filia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash  Druck: Leroquais, Bd. 2, S. 346\endash 347; (72r) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Oratio devotissima ad beatissimam virginem Mariam et sanctum Iohannem evangelistam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 O intemerata et in eternum benedicta singularis atque incomparabilis virgo dei genitrix Maria gratissimum dei templum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Wilmart, Auteurs spirituels, S. 479\endash 482; Leroquais, Bd. 2, S. 434f.}

