ie virginis et martyris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 841; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In vigilia sancti Mathei apostoli et ewangeliste\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 843; (435) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In die\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 844; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancti Mauricii et sociorum eius\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 845; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sanctorum martyrum Cosme et Damiani\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 8; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancti Mychaelis archangeli\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 847; (439) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancti Jheronimi presbyteris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 848; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancti Remigii episcopi et confessoris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 849; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancti Francisci confessoris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 851; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancti Marci pape\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 852; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancti Dyonisii et sociorum eius\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 853; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancti Eduardi confessoris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancti Luce ewangeliste\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 855; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sanctarum XIum milium virginum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 856; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancti Seuerini episcopi\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In vigilia apostolorum Symonis et Jude\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 858; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In die\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 857; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In vigilia omnium sanctorum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 860; (440) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In die sancto\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 861; (441) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In commemoracione omnium defunctorum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 862; (447) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sanctorum