\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 546\endash 667 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Sequentiar}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  De tempore und de sanctis gemischt, vgl. Ms. D 12, fol. 249r\endash 313r, teilweise mit Abweichungen von Guerrini, v.a. bei den Sequenzen. (546) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In die sancto natalis domini nostri Jhesu Christi ad summam missam sequencia et festis sequentibus et sabbatis usque ad purificacionem inclusiue\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Letabundus exultet fidelis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 54, Nr. 2; (548) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In die sancto solempnis pasche et duobus sequentibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Victime paschali laudes\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 54, Nr. 7; (549) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In ascensione\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Omnes gentes plaudite\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 54, Nr. 152; (553) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In die sancto penthecostes\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancti spiritus assit nobis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 gracia\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 53, Nr. 70; (557) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria IIa et IIIa post diem penthecostes\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Veni sancte spiritus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 54, Nr. 153; (559) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo beatissime trinitatis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Profitentes vnitatem ueneremur\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 54, Nr. 161; (562) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo sacri corporis domini nostri Jhesu Christi\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Lauda Syon saluatorem\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 50, Nr. 385; (568) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Item de sacramento\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In celesti ierarchia\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 dulcis sonat armonia \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  RH 27993; (571) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In anniuersario dedicationis ecclesie\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Psallat ecclesia mater \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 53, Nr. 247; (573) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In die consecracionis et anniuersario\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Rex Salomon fecit \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 55, Nr. 31, vgl. Ms. D 12, S. 324v\endash 326v; (577) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo sancti Johannis apostoli et ewangeliste\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Verbum dei deo natum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 55, Nr. 188. \endash Lit.: Hamburger, Leaves, darin zur Ausgestaltung des Textabschnitts siehe Beitrag Hamburger, Inscribing; (582) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In utroque festo beati Pauli\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Paule doctor gencium omnium credencium\u8230 \'85\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  \endash \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 \u8230 \'85 cum palma victorie amen \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  (so nicht in AH), vgl. Ms. D 12, fol. 264vff.; (584) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In annunciacione dominica\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ave Maria gratia plena \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 54, Nr. 216; (587) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo beati Petri martyris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Adest dies celebris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 55, Nr. 293; (590) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In utroque festo sancte crucis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24   Salue salutare lignum \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 34, Nr. 14; (592) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In utroque festo verissimi Dominici patris nostri\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In celesti ierarchia\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 55, Nr. 115; (595) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo sancti Johannis baptiste\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Precursorem summi regis \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 42, Nr. 252; (599) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo apostolorum Petri et Pauli\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Iubar mundo geminatur \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 42, Nr. 312; (602) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo diuisionis Apostolorum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Celi enarrant gloriam Dei\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 50, Nr. 267; (608) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo beate Marie Magdalene\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Monti Syon dat\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 8, Nr. 230; (611) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo sancti Petri apostoli ad vincula\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Verbum Dei incarnatum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 44, Nr. 269; (616) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In die assumpcionis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ave preclara maris stella\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 50, Nr. 241; (621) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Infra octavas assumptionis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Salue mater saluatoris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 54, Nr. 245, Str. 1\endash 3, 5, 7\endash 8, 19\endash 24; (624) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In octaua assumpcionis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Omnis celi iherarchia\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 9, Nr. 76; (628) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo beati Augustini episcopi\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De profundis tenebrarum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 55, Nr. 75; (631) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In nativitate sancte Marie\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Natiuitas Marie virginis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 54, Nr. 188; (633) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo omniu