 AH Bd. 54, Nr. 282; (659) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Item alia\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ave virgo graciosa\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 54, Nr. 278; (662) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Alia\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ave virgo gloriosa\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 54, Nr. 277; (665) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Alia\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Saluatoris mater pia\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 54, Nr. 280; (667); >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In vigilia pasche per horas ante missam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24   Exultet iam angelica turba\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  RH 5868, bricht ab, Schluss ist auf pag. 692 nachgetragen; (676) [De sancto Johanne evangelista], \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Exortum lumen lux \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 9, Nr. 252. \endash Hamburger/Marti/Massey, S. 400, vgl. Ms. D 12, fol. 262v\endash 264v; (679) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De sancto Johanne baptista\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Elysabet Zacharie magnum virum \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 9, S. 240; (684) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De sancto Johanne baptista\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ivbilemus in hac die qua baptiste \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 9, Nr. 239; (688) [Hymnus de sancto Johanne] \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 O nimis felix meritique \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 2, Nr. 53, Str. 1; (689) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De communi sanctorum apostolorum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Creatoris laude pie\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 9, Nr. 377.}

