\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 13r\endash 168r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Graduale, Proprium de tempore}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  Ges\u228 \'e4nge der Messe vom ersten Adventssonntag bis zum 23. Sonntag nach Pfingsten\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24   \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  Das Graduale entspricht weitgehend dem Ordinarium des dominikanischen Prototyps, ed. Guerrini Nr. 572\endash 719, ohne Sequenzen, vgl. mit geringf\u252 \'fcgigen Abweichungen Ms. D 11, pag. 22\endash 366. (13r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominica prima in aduentu domini\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (14r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominica secunda\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (15v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominica tercia\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (16v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria IIII\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (18r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria sexta\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (19r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sabbato\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (23r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominica iiii<\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; (23v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In vigilia natalis domini\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (25r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In nocte natalis domini in galli cantu\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (26v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus antiphone\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. Guerrini Nr. 42; (27v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In aurora\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (29r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad summam missam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (30v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominica infra octavam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (31v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In circumcisione domini\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (32r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In vigilia epyphanie\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In epyphania<\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; (33v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominica infra octavam epyphanie<\plain \f