\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 181r\endash 200v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Proprium de sanctis}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  Ges\u228 \'e4nge der Messe von der Vigil am Vorabend des St. Andreasfestes (29. Nov.) bis zum Fest des hl. Ambrosius von Mailand (4. Apr.). Das Graduale bringt auch hier f\u252 \'fcr die meisten Sonntage nur Responsorium, Alleluia, Vers und Communio; vollst\u228 \'e4ndige Offizien finden sich zum Fest der Bekehrung des hl. Paulus und zu Maria Lichtmess. (181r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In vigilia sancti Andree apostoli\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 725; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In die\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 726; (181v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancte Barbare virginis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancti Nycolai\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 727; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In conceptione beate Marie\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (182v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancte Lucie virginis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 730; (183r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancti Thome apostoli\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 731; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancti Stephani protomartiris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 732; (184v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancti Johannis euangeliste\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 733; (186r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sanctorum innocentum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 734; (186v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancti Thome episcopi et martyris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 735; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancti Siluestri confessoris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 736; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancti Antonii abbatis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 743; (187r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sanctorum Fabiani et Sebastiani<\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  Guerrini Nr. 745; (187v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancte Agnetis virginis et martyris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 746; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancti Vincentii martyris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 747; (188v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In conuersione sancti Pauli apostoli officium\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 749; (190v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In purificacione beate Marie virginis officium\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 753\endash 754; (192v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancti Blasii\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 755; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancte Agathe\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 756; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In cathedra sancti Petri\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 760; (194r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancti Mathie apostoli\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 761; (194v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancti Gregorii\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 763; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancti Thome de Aquino\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancti Benedicti\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 764; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In annunciacione dominica\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 765; (196v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancti Ambrosii\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < Guerrini Nr. 766.}

