\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 152v\endash 164r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Cantica veteris et novi testamenti}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  Die einzelnen Cantica werden durch zwei- bis dreizeilige Lombarden mit Fleuronn\u233 \'e9e-Verzierung eingeleitet. [Cantica minora]: (152v)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 >Canticum Ysaie<. Confitebor tibi domine \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 (Is 12,1\endash 6); (153r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Canticum Ezechie\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ego dixi in dimidio dierum meorum \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 (Is 38,10\endash 20); (154r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Canticum Anne<. Exultauit cor meum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  (I Sm 2,1\endash 10); (155r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Canticum filiorum Israhel<. Cantemus Domino\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  (Ex 15,1\endash 19); (156r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Canticum Abacuc<. Domine audiui auditionem tuam \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 (Hab 3,2\endash 19); (157v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Canticum Moysi<. Audite celi que loquor \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 (Dt 32,1\endash 43); (161r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ymnus trium puerorum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Benedicite omnia opera domini \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 (Dn 3,57\endash 88); [Cantica maiora]: (161v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Canticum Zacharie\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <.\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Benedictus \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 (Lc 1,68\endash 79); (162v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Canticum beate Marie\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Magnificat\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  (Lc 1,46\endash 55); (163r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Symeonis<. Nunc dimittis \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 (Lc 2,29\endash 32).}

