\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 196v\endash 200v Marienoffizien f\u252 \'fcr die Samstage in den verschieden gepr\u228 \'e4gten Zeiten des liturgischen Jahres. (196v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad memoriam de beata virgine in aduentu\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (197r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In officio beate virginis in sabbatis ab octava epiphanie usque ad pentecosten\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (198r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In La\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (199r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Post purificationem beate Marie in sabbatis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Alma redemtoris mater\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  RH Nr. 861,2; (199v) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Aue stella matutina\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 48, Nr. 261; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De dominica post completarium\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 : \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Salve regina misericordie \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 50, Nr. 245; (200r) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ave regina celorum \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 CAO 1542, vgl. Guerrini Nr. 481.}

