\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 202r\endash 207r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Hymnarium, Hymni de tempore}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  Von Advent bis zum Passionssonntag. (202r) Amenmelodien f\u252 \'fcr die unterschiedlichen Tonarten (\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 re\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 , \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 my\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 , \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 ut\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ); >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In aduentu domini ad vesperas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Conditor alme siderum \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 47, Str. 1\endash 4, 5\endash 7; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Verbum supernum prodiens\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 51, Nr. 48; (202v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Vox clara ecce\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 51, Nr. 49; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In natiuitate domini ad vesperas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Veni redemptor gentium\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 50, Nr. 8, Str. 2\endash 8 von \u8218 \'82Intende qui regis Israel\lquote \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  \endash Lit.: St\u228 \'e4blein, Hymnen (I), S. XVI; Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge am Rand; (203r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad matutinam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Christe redemptor omnium\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 51, Nr. 50; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 A solis ortus cardine \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 50, Nr. 53, Str. 1\endash 7; (203v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In epiphania domini ad vesperas et ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Hostis Herodes impie \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 50, Nr. 53, Str. 8\endash 9, 11, 13 von \u8218 \'82A solis ortus cardine\lquote \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  \endash Lit.: St\u228 \'e4blein, Hymnen (I), S. XVI; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 A patre vnigenitus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 2, Nr. 107; (204r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In sabbatis ad vesperas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 O lux beata trinitas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 51, Nr. 40; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad completorium\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Te lucis ante terminum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 51, Nr. 44; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Nocte surgentes vigilemus omnes \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 24; (204v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ecce iam noctis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 51, Nr. 31; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad primam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Iam lucis orto sydere \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 41; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad tertiam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Nunc sancte nobis spiritus \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 50, Nr. 18; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad sextam<\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Rector potens uerax deus \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 50, Nr. 19; (205r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad IX\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Rerum deus tenax vigor\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 50, Nr. 20; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad vesperas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Lucis creator optime \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 34; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ferialibus diebus ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Nocte surgentes vigilemus omnes \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 24, Str. 1; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad horas cantus ferialis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Iam lucis orto sydere \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 (205v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ferialibus diebus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Lucis creator optime\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In XLam ad vesperas usque ad dominicam in passione\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Audi benigne conditor\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 51, Nr. 54; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad completorium\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Christe qui lux es et dies\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 51, Nr. 22; (206r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad matutinam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Summi largitor premii\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 51, Nr. 60; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Iam Christe sol iusticie\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 51, Nr. 59, Str. 1\endash 5; (206v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominica in passione ad vesperam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Vexilla regis prodeunt \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 50, Nr. 67, Str. 1, 3\endash 8; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad matutinam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Pange lingua gloriosi\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 50, Nr. 66, Str. 1\endash 5; (207r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Lustra sex qui iam peracta \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 50, Nr. 66, Str. 6\endash 10 von \u8218 \'82Pange lingua gloriosi\lquote \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  }

