\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 207r\endash 212v {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Hymnarium, Hymni de sanctis}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  (207r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo innocentium ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <.\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Que vox que poterit\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 50, Nr. 153, Str. 5\endash 6 von \u8218 \'82Sanctorum meritis inclita gaudia\lquote ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 >In laudibus<. Katerua matrum personat \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 50, Nr. 53, Str. 10 von \u8218 \'82A solis ortus cardine\lquote ; (207v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In conuersione sancti Pauli ad vesperas et ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <.\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Doctor egregie Paule\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 23, Nr. 450, Str. 1, 5; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo purificationis beate Virginis ad vesperas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ave maris stella \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 123; (208r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Quem terra pontus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 2, Nr. 27, Str. 1\endash 2, 4; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 >In laudibus<. O gloriosa domina \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 50, Nr. 72, Divisio von \u8218 \'82Quem terra pontus\lquote , Str. 6\endash 8; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In cathedra sancti Petri ad vesperas et ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Iam bone pastor \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 188, Str. 3, 6 von \u8218 \'82Aurea luce et decore roseo\lquote ; (208v) Initien zu vorangegangenen Melodien: >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ihesu redemptor\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In annunciatione ad uesperas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Aue maris stella\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad matutinam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Quem terra pontus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 O gloriosa domina\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festis apostolorum et euangelistarum ad vesperam et ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Exultet celum laudibus \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 108; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 >In laudibus<. Eterna Christi munera \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 50, Nr. 17, Str. 1\endash 2, 6\endash 8; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo vnius martyris ad vesperas et ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Deus tuorum militum \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 114a; (209r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Martir Dei qui vnicum \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 113, Str. 1\endash 3; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De martyribus pluribus in simplicibus ad vesperas et ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sanctorum meritis inclita gaudia \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 50, Nr. 153; (209v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festis trium lectionum in laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Eeterna Christi munera\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 50, Nr. 17, Str. 1, 3\endash 5, 8; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo vnius confessoris duplici ad vesperas et ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Iste confessor domini sacratus \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 118, weitere Melodien zu verschiedenen Festgraden: >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De vno confessoris trium lectionum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < und >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festis simplicibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (210r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Jhesu redemptor omnium corona confitencium \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 117; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De virginibus in simplicibus ad vesperas et ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Virginis proles opifexque matris \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 121; weitere Melodie zu: >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festis vnius virginis trium lectionum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (210v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Jhesu corona uirginum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 50, Nr. 21; verschiedene Melodien zu verschiedenen Festgraden zu \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Iam lucis orto sydere\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 , vgl. fol. 204v: >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festis duplicibus et supra\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (211r)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 >In festo semiduplici<\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo simplici\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festis trium lectionum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Infra octavas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In sextis feriis quando de cruce tenetur \u8230 \'85 ad vesperas et ad matutinas<. Salue crux sancta \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 50, Nr. 223, Str. 1\endash 2, 5; (211v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Originale crimen necans\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 50, Nr. 223, Str. 3\endash 4, vgl. auch Reijners, S. 73, Anm. 42; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De beata virgine ad vesperas quando de ea fit in sabbatis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Aue maris stella \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 vgl. fol. 207v; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 >Ad matutinas<. Quem terra pontus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 , vgl. fol.208r; abschlie\u223 \'dfend nach dem Ablauf des Kirchenjahres geordnete Anf\u228 \'e4nge verschiedener Hymnen mit Hinweisen, wann diese zu singen sind.}

