\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 233va\endash 248vb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Hymnarium, Hymni de tempore et de sanctis et de commune sanctorum}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  (233va) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In utroque festo sancte crucis et quandocumque de ea agetur in VIa feriis ad vesperas et matutinas<.\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Salue crux sancta\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 50, Nr. 223, Str. 1\endash 2, 5, vgl. auch Reijners, S. 72f.; (234ra) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <, Divisio des vorigen Hymnus, Str. 3\endash 4; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo corone domini ad vesperas et matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Eterne regi glorie\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 52, Nr. 12; (234va) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 >In laudibus<. Lauda fidelis concio\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 52, Nr. 13; (234vb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In nativitate sancti Iohannis baptiste ad vesperas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ut queant laxis \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 50, Nr. 96, Str. 1\endash 4, 13; (235rb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Antra deserti teneris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 , Divisio des vorigen Hymnus, Str. 5\endash 8; (235va) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <,\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 O nimis felix\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 , weitere Divisio, Str. 9\endash 13; (235vb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo apostolorum Petri et Pauli ad uesperas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Aurea luce et decore roseo \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 188, Str. 1\endash 2, 5\endash 6; (236ra) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In commemoratione sancti Pauli ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Doctor egregie Paule\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 , Divisio des vorigen Hymnus, Str. 3, 6; (236rb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Eterna Christi\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  [munera], nur Incipit, vgl. AH Bd. 50, Nr. 17; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancte Praxedis uirginis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Huius obtentu\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 , nur Incipit, vgl. AH Bd. 51, Nr. 121, Str. 4; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sancte Magdalene ad vesperas et ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Lauda mater ecclesia \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 52, Nr. 283, Str. 1\endash 4, 6\endash 7; (236vb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Eterni patris vnice\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 52, Nr. 284, Str. 1\endash 3, 6\endash 7; (237ra) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo Marthe ad vesperas et ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Huius obtentu\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 , nur Incipit, vgl. AH Bd. 51, Nr. 121, Str. 4; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ihesu corona \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 [virginum], nur Incipit, vgl. AH Bd. 2, Nr. 104; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo Petri ad uincula ad uesperas et ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Iam bone pastor\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 , Divisio von \u8218 \'82Aurea luce et decore roseo\lquote AH Bd. 51, Nr. 188, Str. 3\endash 4; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Eterna Cristi\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  [munera], nur Incipit, vgl. AH Bd. 50, Nr. 17; (237rb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo sancte Helene ad vesperas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Factor orbis et omnium\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 4, Nr. 274; (237va) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo Augustini ad vesperas et ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Magne pater Augustine\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 52, Nr. 117; (238ra) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Celi ciues applaudite et vos fratres\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 52, Nr. 118, Str. 1, 3\endash 6; (238rb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo sancti Michaelis ad uesperas et ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Tibi Criste splendor patris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 50, Nr. 156; (238vb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Criste sanctorum decus angelorum \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 50, Nr. 146; (239rb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo sancti Remigii ad vesperas et matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Iste confessor domini sacratus \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 118, Str. 1/2, mit abweichender Strophenaufteilung; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo vndecim milium virginum ad vesperas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Gaude sancta Colonia \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 vgl. AH Bd. 4, Nr. 473, Str. 1\endash 3, 5; (239vb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Nocte surgentes virginum \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 52, Nr. 372; (240ra) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Hymnum sanctis virginibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 52, Nr. 371, Str. 1\endash 4; (240rb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo omnium sanctorum ad vesperas et ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ihesu saluator seculi\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 51, Nr. 130; (240vb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Criste redemptor omnium\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 51, Nr. 129; (241ra) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo sancte Katherine virginis et martyris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Katherinae collaudemus virtutum insignia\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 52, Nr. 245, Str. 1\endash 3, mit Doxologie; (241rb) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 >Ad matutinas<. Pange lingua gloriose virginis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 52, Nr. 246, Str. 1 und vom vorigen Hymnus Str. 5, 7, mit textlichen Abweichungen, Doxologie; (241va) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Presens dies expedantur\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 52, Nr. 247, Str. 1, 3\endash 4; (241vb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo apostolorum et ewangelistarum ad vesperas et ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Exsultet celum laudibus \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 108, ohne Notation; (242rb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Eterna Christi munera\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 50, Nr. 17, Str. 1\endash 2, 6\endash 8; (242va) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In communi unius martyris ad vesperas et ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Deus tuorum militum \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 114a; (242vb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In inuencione sancti Stephani prothomartyris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Laus et perhennis gloria\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 \u8230 \'85; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 >In laudibus<. Martir Dei qui vnicum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 51, Nr. 113, Str. 1\endash 3; (243ra) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De martiribus ad vesperas et ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sanctorum meritis inclita gaudia\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 50, Nr. 153; (243va) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Eterna Cristi munera\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 50, Nr. 17, Str. 1, 3\endash 5, 8; (243vb) Hymnentexte zu Festen eines Bekenners bzw. einer Jungfrau mit verschiedenen Melodien zu unterschiedlichen Festgraden: \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 >In festo semiduplici vnius confessoris ad vesperas et ad matutinas<.\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Iste confessor domini sacratus \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 118; (244rb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ihesu redemptor omnium corona\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 2, Nr. 100; (244va) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo simplici vnius confessoris ad vesperas et ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Iste confessor domini\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; (244vb)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 >In festo trium lectionum vnius confessoris<. Iste confessor domini sacratus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; (245ra) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De virginibus ymnus ad vesperas et ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  Virginis proles opifexque matris \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 121, mit Doxologie; (245rb) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 >In laudibus<. Jhesu corona virginum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 2, Nr. 104, mit Doxologie; Marienfeste: (245va) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In omnibus festis beate virginis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Aue maris stella \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 123; (246ra) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Quem terra pontus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 2, Nr. 27, Str. 1\endash 2, 4, mit zwei weiteren Str. und Doxologie; (246va) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 O gloriosa domina excelsa supra sidera \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 2, Nr. 27, Str. 5\endash 8; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 >In sabbato quando de beata virgine agitur officium cantus<\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 , Texte wie oben, weitere Melodie; (247r)\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Jam lucis orto sydere\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  mit unterschiedlichen Melodien zu den verschiedenen Festgraden; (248r) weitere Hymnenanf\u228 \'e4nge zu verschiedenen Festgraden.}

