\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 110r\endash 219r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Proprium sanctorum}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  Aufbau wie im Commune sanctorum; Heiligenfeste vom Fest des hl. Johannes (24. Juni) bis zur hl. Felicitas (23. Nov.). (110r) [In nativitate sancti Johannis baptistae], Beginn fehlt, Blattverlust; Ant.: \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominus ab vtero vocat me de ventre\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  CAO 2400; (117r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In natali sanctorum Petri et Pauli apostolorum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Johannis et Pauli martyrum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Leonis pape\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; (126v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In commemoratione sancti Pauli apostoli\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <, bricht in der Laudesantiphon ab, Blattverlust; (136r) [In festo visitationis BMV] Beginn fehlt, Blattverlust; (144r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominica infra octavam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (144v) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Vdalrici episcopi\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In octaua apostolorum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (145v) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Kyliani et sociorum eius martyrum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In octaua visitacionis Mariae\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Septem fratrum martyrum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In commemoracione sancti patris nostri Benedicti abbatis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Margarete virginis et martyris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Praxedis virginis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo sancte Marie Magdalene\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (151r) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Apollinaris episcopi et martyris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Jacobi apostoli\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (151v) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Eodem die Christofori martyris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Anne vidue\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Panthaleonis martyris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Felicis pape et martyris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Eodem die Simplicii, Faustini et Beatricis martyrum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Abdon und Sennes martyrum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad vincula Petri apostoli\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (152v) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Eodem die septem Machabeorum martyrum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Stephani pape et martyris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In inuentione sancti Stephani prothomartyris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (158v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sixti pape et martyris<\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Eodem die Felicissimi et Agapiti martyrum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ciriaci et sociorum eius martyrum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Romani martyris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo sancti Laurentii martyris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <, bricht ab, Blattverlust; (167r) [In festo assumptionis sanctae Mariae], Beginn fehlt, Blattverlust, // \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 conuallium\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Veni electa mea et ponam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 \u8230 \'85; (175r) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 >Dominica infra octauam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In octaua sancti Laurentii\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Agapiti martyris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 >Bernhardi confessoris<\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In octaua assumptionis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Eodem die Timothei et Simphoriani martyrum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Bartholomei apostoli\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Augustini episcopi\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Eodem die Hermetis martyris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 >In festo decollationis sancti Iohannis baptiste<\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 , bricht ab, Blattverlust; (177r) [In festo nativitatis Mariae], Beginn fehlt, // \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dauid, per quam salus mundi credentibus apparuit\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  CAO 6854; (183r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominica infra octauam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Prothi et Iacinthi, Felicis et Regule martyrum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In exaltatione sancte crucis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (185v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In octaua natiuitatis Marie\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Eodem die Nycomedis martyris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Eufemie virginis et martyris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Eodem die Lucie et Geminiani martyrum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Lamberti episcopi et martyris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Mathei apostoli et euangeliste\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Mauritii et sociorum eius martyrum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Cosme et Damiani martirum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo sancti Michaelis archangeli et omnium beatorum spirituum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <, bricht ab, Blattverlust; (195v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Iheronimi confessoris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Remigii episcopi\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Leodegarii episcopi et martyris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Marci pape\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Eodem die Sergii, Bachi et Apulei martyrum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dyonisii et sociorum eius martyrum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Gereonis et sociorum eius martyrum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Kalixti pape et martyris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Galli confessoris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Luce euangeliste\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Vndecim milium virginum martyrum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Seueri episcopi\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Seuerini episcopi\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Crispini et Crispiniani martyrum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Symonis et Iude\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo omnium sanctorum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (201v) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Eustachii et sociorum eius martyrum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Leonardi confessoris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Willibrordi episcopi\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Quatuor coronatorum martyrum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Theodori martyris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In festo sancti Martini episcopi\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (210r) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Brictii episcopi\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Elisabeth uidue\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In presentatione beate Marie virginis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Eodem die Columbani\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Cecilie virginis et martyris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; (216v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Clementis pape et martyris\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (219r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Eodem die Felicitatis martyris\plain 