\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 1r\endash 74r {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Nokturnale, Proprium de tempore}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  Ges\u228 \'e4nge der sonnt\u228 \'e4glichen Matutin der Zeit von Septuagesima bis Karsamstag. Invitatorium, Responsorien mit Versus zu jeweils drei Nokturnen, Laudes-Antiphonen (ab Quadragesima) sowie Benedictus-Antiphonen (ab Quadragesima auch f\u252 \'fcr die Werktage). Beginn wegen Blatt- bzw. auch Lagenverlustes inmitten der 1. Nokturn zu Sexagesima. (1r) [Dominica in sexagesima], Beginn fehlt, Blattverlust; // \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 uit igitur Dominus hominem\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  CAO 6739; (6v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominica in quinquagesima\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (12r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria quarta in capite ieiunii\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria quinta\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (12v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria sexta\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sabbato\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominica prima in quadragesima\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (20v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Priuatis diebus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria secunda\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (21r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria tercia\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria quarta\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (21v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria quinta\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria sexta\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sabbato\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (22r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominica secunda<\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; (28v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria secunda\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria tercia\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (29r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria quarta<\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria quinta<\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria sexta<\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; (29v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sabbato\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominica tercia\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (37r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria secunda\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria tercia\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria quarta<\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria quinta\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (37v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria sexta\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sabbato\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominica quarta\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (44v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria secunda\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (45r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria tercia\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria quarta\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria quinta\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (45v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria sexta\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sabbato\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (46r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominica passionis domini\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (53v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria secunda\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria tercia\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (54r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria quarta\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria quinta\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria sexta\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (54v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sabbato\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominica palmarum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (62v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria secunda\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (63v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria tercia\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (65v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria quarta\plain \f2\lang1033\f