\pard\sl276\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa195\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 146vb\endash 159rb {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Cantica}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  Die Cantica werden durch Rankeninitialen eingeleitet. [Cantica minora] f\u252 \'fcr die Laudes der Wochentage: (146vb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Incipiunt cantica dominica die\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Benedicite omnia opera domini \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 (Dn 3,57\endash 88); (147vb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria secunda canticum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Confitebor tibi domine \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 (Is 12,1\endash 6); (148rb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria tercia canticum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ego dixi\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  (Is 38,10\endash 20); (149ra) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria quarta canticum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Exultauit cor meum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  (Sm I 2,1\endash 10); (150ra) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria quinta canticum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Cantemus domino\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  (Ex 15,1\endash 19); (151rb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria sexta canticum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Domine audiui auditionem tuam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  (Hab 3,2\endash 19); (152vb) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sabbato canticum<. Audite celi que loquor \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 (Dt 32,1\endash 43); [Cantica maiora] f\u252 \'fcr die Sonntage: (156ra) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Canticum Zacharie\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Benedictus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  (Lc 1,68\endash 79), zu den Laudes; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Canticum beate Marie\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Magnificat\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  (Lc 1,46\endash 55), zur Vesper; (157ra) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Canticum Symeonis<. Nunc dimittis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  (Lc 2,29\endash 32), zur Complet.}

