\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 378r\endash 390r{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Hymnar}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  Hymni de tempore. (378r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Per adventum ad completorium exceptis festis sanctorum ymnus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (378v) \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Quem terra pontus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 50, S. 86, Nr. 72; (379r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad tertiam eisdem diebus preter festa sanctorum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Conditor alme siderum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 51, Nr. 47; (380r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In nativitate domini nostri Jesu Christi\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Intende qui regis Israel\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 50, Nr. 8; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Divisio\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Procedit de thalamo suo\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 , vgl. James Mearns: Early Latin Hymnaries. An Index of Hymns in Hymnaries before 1100, Cambridge 1913, S. 69; (381r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad completorium usque ad octavam epyphanie\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Enixa est puerpera\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 , vgl. AH Bd. 50, Nr. 53, Str. 5\endash 7; (381v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad tertiam eodem tempore sine intermissione\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 A solis ortus cardine\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 , vgl. AH Bd. 50, Nr. 53, Str. 1\endash 4; (382v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In epyphania domini. In vesperis et in laudibus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Illuminans altissimus micantium\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 50, Nr. 10; (383v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad nocturnos\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Intende qui regis Israhel\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; AH Bd. 50, Nr. 8; (384r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad completorium in XLa usque ad dominicam in passione domini preter festa sanctorum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Summi largitor premii\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 51, Nr. 60, mit erheblichen Abweichungen; (384v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad tertiam ymnus usque in passione domini preter festa sanctorum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Audi benigne conditor\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 51, Nr. 54; (385r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominica in passione domini usque in vigilia pasche preter festa sanctorum et dominicam palmarum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Hymnum dicamus domino\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 51, Nr. 75; (386r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Divisio\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Denariorum numero Christus \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 RH 4351; (386v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad completorium usque in vigiliam pasche exceptis festis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Crux fidelis inter omnes \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 50, Nr. 66, Str. 8\endash 10; (387v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad tertiam ymnus usque in diem palmarum exceptis festis sanctorum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Vexilla regis prodeunt fulget\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 12, Nr. 493, Textabbruch aufgrund von Blattverlust; (388r) [Dominica palmarum] \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Magnum salutis gaudium\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 51, Nr. 74, Beginn unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig wegen Blattverlust; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Divisio<.\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ramos virentes sumpserat\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  RH 17005; (389r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Eodem die et per totam sequentem septimanam ad terciam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < AH Bd. 50, Nr. 6.}

