\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 1\endash 334 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Antiphonale officii, Proprium de tempore}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  Zun\u228 \'e4chst Blattverlust; Textbeginn mit der ersten Nokturn des ersten Advents. (1) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In primo nocturno. Ps\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Venite in virtute\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Resp.\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Aspiciens a longe ecce video\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  CAO 6129, daran schlie\u223 \'dfen die liturgischen Formulare der Horen bis Karsamstag an (vgl. f\u252 \'fcr den Textbestand insgesamt mit geringf\u252 \'fcgigen Abweichungen Huot, S. 328\endash 349), danach nahtloser \u220 \'dcbergang zum Proprium de sanctis. (12) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria secunda\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (17) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominica secunda\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (27) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria secunda\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (29) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria tertia\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (30) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria Va\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria VIa\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (31) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Sabbato\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (32) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Dominica tertia\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (43) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria II\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (46) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria tertia\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (47) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria quarta\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (52) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria quinta\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (53) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Feria VIa\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (61) [Dominica quarta adventus]; (79) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In vigilia nativitatis\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <; (86) [In die nativitatis domini]; (105) >\plain \f2\i\lan