\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 389v\endash 395v{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Cantica}}\plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs22 , \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 zu verschiedenen Anl\u228 \'e4ssen. >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Cantica tempore\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 resurrectionis domini\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 < (390r) [Quis]\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 est iste qui venit de Edom \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 (Is 63,1\endash 5); Text wegen ausgeschnittener Q-Initiale zu Beginn unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Aliud\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Venite et revertamur ad dominum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  (Os 6,1\endash 6); (390v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Aliud\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Expecta me dicit dominus in die resurrectionis \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 (So 3,8\endash 13); (391r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Cantica dominicalia et de sancto Michaele\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Domine miserere nostri te enim expectavimus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  (Is 33,2\endash 10); >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Aliud\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Audite qui longe estis que fecerim\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  (Is 33,13\endash 18); (391v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Aliud\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Miserere domine plebi tue super quam invocatum est\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  (Sir 36,14\endash 19); (392r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De sancta cruce\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Domine audivi auditionem tuam\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  (Ab 3,2\endash 6); \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Pro iniquitate vidi tentoria\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  (Ab 3,7\endash 19); (393r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De corona spinea\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Pedibus conculcabitur corona superbie\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  (Is 28,3\endash 6); >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De apostolis et martiribus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Vos sancti domini vocabimini ministri dei\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  (Is 61,6\endash 9); >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Aliud\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Fulgebunt iusti et tamquam scintille in arundineto\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  (Sap 3,7\endash 9); (394r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Aliud\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Reddet deus mercedem laborum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  (Sap 10,17\endash 20); >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 De uno martire et confessoribus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Beatus vir qui in sapientia morabitur\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  (Sir 14,22; 15,3\endash 4.6); (394v) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Aliud\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Benedictus vir qui confidit\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  (Ier 17,7\endash 8); >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Aliud\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Beatus vir qui inventus est sine macula\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  (Sir 31,8\endash 11); >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In natali virginum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Audite me divini fructus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ; (Sir 39,17\endash 21); (395r) >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Aliud\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Gaudens gaudebo\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  (Is 61,10 ff.), Schluss ab Is 61,11 unvollst\u228 \'e4ndig aufgrund der fehlenden Blatth\u228 \'e4lfte von fol. 395.}

