\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 (Rot \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 17\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f2\scaps\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Hymnar.}}\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 [In dedicatione ecclesie. Ad vesperas]\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Urbs beata Jerusalem\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 2, Nr. 93, der Anfang (Str. 1, V. 1\endash 4a) fehlt, mit Divisio zu den Laudes \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Angulare fundamentum\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 , vgl. RH 1081; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 In\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 conceptione beate Marie virginis. Ad vesperas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ave maris stella \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 AH Bd. 51, Nr. 123; Bd. 2, Nr. 29; >\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad matutinas\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Quem terra pontus\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22  AH Bd. 50, Nr. 72, Str. 1\endash 2 (\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 visce\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 ).}

